{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:263","content":{"id":263,"title":"45 新冠病毒","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ef7bdac3-c6ff-42c4-b9ee-3b956d6699c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在疫情初始阶段，这种名为严重急性呼吸综合征冠状病毒2（SARS-2），被称为冠状病毒，但冠状病毒是一类病毒，而非某一种病毒，当时由于传播一太快，错过了去一个恰当名字的机会。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c9a1c475-4642-4500-85b3-17b7931b58df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"能感染人类的有好几种不同的冠状病毒，15% 的感冒就是由某种冠状病毒。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e28402e9-ce1d-4836-a4d9-544679f97326","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"过去爆发的几种冠状病毒："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e144edcc-8e6d-4332-bbbe-f0c9ae61cd29","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1fabbb14-5432-4663-a02d-2ab76d2861de","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6673b0c6-889d-4322-8aca-81e83829ba7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SARS 病毒，引起严重的呼吸系统疾病，在全球造成了 8000 多人感染，900 人死亡"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9241c3dd-60fc-40c7-b627-da5b29f69729","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"88c69175-c045-4006-824f-56bdacac6bd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MERS，中东呼吸综合征，比 SARS 更致命，感染人数只有 2500 人，但是超过 1/3 的感染者人死亡"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a7f81e1-dede-4eda-b8b4-484ca34435de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"新冠病毒，传染性比前两种强，但是致死性弱得多。这种病毒针对的是 ACE2 这种受体，和调节血压有关，这意味着很多细胞都有这种受体，因此感染，比如鼻腔和肺部的上皮细胞。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8ce2f68-ac6d-47b2-a0f7-0ed556898b33","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"新冠病毒能终止干扰素的释放，但是被感染的细胞仍可以释放各种各样的细胞因子引发炎症，惊动免疫系统，所以病毒可以感染大量细胞，不由限制的扩散，同时引发炎症，激发免疫系统后又引发炎症。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd1a850f-b72f-42c6-9581-91f8b0ac7679","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"炎症和活化的免疫系统会严重损伤肺部，随着上皮细胞死去，肺泡裸漏出来，并在后面战斗中死亡，如果到了这种地步，就需要机械通气，但是这样会让细菌长驱直入，可能引发并发的细菌感染，导致免疫系统引发更严重的炎症，形成恶性循环。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6deebf66-7f7d-42e7-a51c-118f833706bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大面积的肺部炎症会造成不可逆的损伤。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7e936824-3423-4dd4-b363-64bdc5d73b47","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在重症患者身上，还出现凝血级联反应，血液中负责让伤口愈合的成分机会，在血管中凝结，导致器官缺氧，同时肺部充满液体，呼吸更困难。同时凝血还会导致中风、心肌梗死。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第四部分 反叛与内战"},{"label":"45 新冠病毒","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:263","type":"doc","id":263}}],"prevPage":{"title":"44 免疫系统与癌症","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:262","type":"doc","id":262}},"createTime":1742173389652,"updateTime":1743303640538,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640538}}